s":"oblique"},{"text":"ஓய்","lemma":"ஓய்","gloss":"vocative"}],"gloss":"O strong one"},{"surface":"நினக்கே","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"},{"text":"அக்கு","lemma":"அக்கு","gloss":"increment"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphatic"}],"gloss":"to you indeed"}]}],"literal":"Swift chariot rutted street in that place / white-mouthed donkey mean herd having yoked / you desolated their wide good fortress / flock of birds chirping fame-abundant fertile fields / white-maned spirited horses curved hooves to leap / chariot you drove your enemies' land / swaying gait thick neck / broad feet angry look / shining tusk male elephant their / protected pond you plunged / such wrath you possess therefore / shining gold inlaid beauty-shining shield with / bright-shining long spear holding enemies / bright army swift vanguard forefront to confront / bringing hope those who came hope behind to remain / disgracefully those who lived are they many? Matchless / good treatise four Vedas / rare fame great offerings / ghee-abundant oblation to overflow many times / imperishable excellence sacrifice having completed / sacrificial post erected wide arena are they many? / Which are many indeed, O Lord? Leather strap having / tightly bound clay-smeared drum / songstress sings for Vañci / seeking filled with strength O strong one to you indeed!","translation":"O Lord of great strength, who seeks and achieves glory! In the lands of your enemies, you yoked herds of white-mouthed donkeys to swift chariots and ploughed up their wide, beautiful fortresses, turning them to ruins. You drove your chariots so that the curved hooves of your white-maned, spirited horses leapt across their fertile, famous fields where flocks of birds once chirped. You made your angry-looking, thick-necked male elephants with shining tusks and swaying gaits plunge into their protected ponds. Since you possess such fierce wrath, are those who lived in disgrace—having confronted your bright army's swift vanguard with their gold-inlaid shields and bright long spears, only to leave behind all their hopes—many? Or are the wide arenas many, where you completed sacrifices of imperishable excellence according to the four Vedas of good treatises, offering abundant ghee till it overflowed, and erected sacrificial posts? Which of these are more numerous, O Lord, for you who are praised in songs of Vañci by songstresses playing tightly-bound, clay-smeared drums?","modern":"விரைந்து செல்லும் தேர்கள் ஓடிய தெருக்களையுடைய பகைவர்களின் அகன்ற நல்ல கோட்டைகளை, வெள்ளை வாயையுடைய கழுதைக் கூட்டங்களைப் பூட்டி உழுது நீ பாழாக்கினாய். பறவைக் கூட்டங்கள் ஒலிக்கும் புகழ்மிக்க விளைவயல்களில், வெள்ளைக் குதிரைகளின் வளைந்த குளம்புகள் பாய்ந்து ஓடத் தேர்களைச் செலுத்தினாய். அசையும் நடையையும், பருத்த கழுத்தையும், அகன்ற அடிகளையும், சினந்த பார்வையையும், ஒளிரும் தந்தங்களையும் உடைய ஆண் யானைகளைப் பகைவர்களின் காவல் மிகுந்த குளங்களில் இறக்கிப் படியச் செய்தாய். அத்தகைய சினத்தை நீ கொண்டுள்ளாய். அதனால், விளங்கும் பொன் பதிக்கப்பட்ட கேடயத்துடனும் நீண்ட வேலுடனும் உனது ஒளிரும் படையை எதிர்க்க வந்து, தோல்வியுற்றுத் தங்கள் ஆசைகள் அழிய அவமானத்துடன் வாழ்பவர்கள் பலரோ? அல்லது, நல்ல நூலாகிய நான்கு வேதங்களின்படி, நெய் மிகுந்த ஆவுதி பொங்கப் பலமுறை வேள்விகளைச் செய்து யூபத் தூண்களை நாட்டிய அகன்ற களங்கள் பலவோ? பெருமானே! வாரால் இறுக்கிக் கட்டப்பட்ட முழவின் இசைக்கேற்பப் பாடினி பாடும் வஞ்சி நகருக்குரிய, பேராற்றல் கொண்ட உனக்கு எவை மிகப்பல?","explanation":"The poet Kapilar praises the Chera king Cēramāṉ Celvak Kaṭuṅkō Vāẕiyātaṉ in the pāṭāṇ tiṇai, which focuses on a king's virtues and deeds. The poet contrasts the king's terrifying, destructive wrath in war with his righteous, peaceful deeds of performing Vedic sacrifices. He asks whether the enemies disgraced by defeat are more numerous, or the sacrificial grounds where the king erected victory posts. The imagery of yoking donkeys to plough enemy fortresses and elephants muddying protected ponds vividly depicts his terrifying power. In contrast, the smoke of ghee-filled sacrifices and the sound of drums and songstresses in Vañci highlight his piety, generosity, and patronage of arts. Key words include 'பாழ்செய்தனை' (you desolated), 'வேள்வி' (sacrifice), 'யூபம்' (sacrificial post), and 'மைந்தினோய்' (O strong one).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.52],[0.52,0.93],[0.93,1.34],[1.58,2.0],[2.0,3.0],[3.0,3.4],[3.4,3.6],[3.6,4.05],[4.05,4.8],[4.8,5.3],[5.3,5.5],[5.5,6.05],[6.05,6.6],[6.6,7.25],[7.47,7.8],[7.8,8.3],[8.3,8.5],[8.5,8.88],[8.88,9.53],[9.53,10.5],[10.5,11.14],[11.14,11.95],[11.95,12.6],[12.6,13.0],[13.0,13.51],[13.74,14.2],[14.2,14.6],[14.6,14.72],[14.95,15.3],[15.3,15.53],[15.64,15.87],[15.87,16.1],[16.1,17.1],[17.84,18.34],[18.34,18.84],[18.84,19.14],[19.14,19.56],[19.56,19.84],[19.84,20.14],[20.14,20.44],[20.44,20.84],[20.84,21.74],[21.74,22.04],[22.04,22.44],[22.44,23.24],[23.24,24.34],[24.34,24.54],[24.54,24.96],[24.96,25.6],[25.6,26.13],[26.67,27.24],[27.24,27.64],[27.64,28.04],[28.04,28.24],[28.64,29.5],[29.5,29.94],[29.94,30.54],[30.54,30.74],[30.74,32.24],[32.24,32.61],[32.61,33.16],[33.16,33.44],[33.44,33.65],[33.86,34.27],[34.27,34.48],[34.9,35.94],[36.64,37.14],[37.14,37.34],[37.34,37.64],[37.64,37.94],[37.94,38.94],[38.94,39.41],[39.41,39.74],[39.74,40.14],[40.14,40.74],[40.74,41.14],[41.14,41.44],[41.44,41.84],[41.84,42.27],[42.27,42.86],[42.86,43.84],[43.84,44.04],[44.04,44.54],[44.54,45.04],[45.04,45.54],[45.54,45.84],[45.84,46.87],[46.87,47.15],[47.15,47.44],[47.44,47.72],[47.72,47.91],[48.94,49.14],[49.14,49.95],[49.95,50.44],[50.44,50.94],[50.94,51.54],[51.54,52.14],[52.14,52.34],[52.34,52.54],[53.72,54.22],[54.22,54.42],[54.42,55.12],[55.12,55.52]],"female":[[0.0,0.47],[0.47,0.85],[0.85,1.23],[1.23,1.75],[1.75,2.1],[2.1,3.6],[3.6,3.9],[3.9,4.45],[4.45,5.2],[5.2,5.7],[5.7,5.9],[5.9,6.1],[6.1,6.58],[6.58,7.06],[7.06,7.2],[7.2,9.2],[9.2,9.4],[9.4,10.1],[10.1,10.66],[10.66,11.5],[11.5,12.03],[12.03,12.7],[12.7,13.23],[13.23,13.76],[13.76,14.43],[14.43,14.96],[14.96,15.33],[15.33,15.51],[15.51,15.96],[15